#. y1:english="Hey,{PA:10} you.{PA:10}||You know the origin of Kage-san's name?\nUmm, no...\nThe legendary informant...{PA:4}||Kage...\nWell, lemme break it down for you.||The name pertains to his past.\nHis past?\nYeah.\nBack in the day,||the boss would use us tramps to collect info.\nHe made it a rule to never||show himself to others.\nEssentially, he moved information from||the depths of the shadows.\n...Even if people were aware of his||existence, nobody had actually ever met him.\nLike some sort of ghost, he only existed||in the darkness provided by the shadows.\nEven within the darkness of the shadows,||the area he dwelled in was especially dark.\nHence the name, \"Kage\"."
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0047.BIN:75_0_0
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0047.BIN::line:75_0_0"
msgid "Oye, {PA:10}tú.||¿Sabes por que llaman Kage a nuestro jefe?"
msgstr ""

