#. y1:english="What's the matter?\nNothing...{PA:20}||Please just leave me alone.\nI have no choice but to hang myself...\nThen do as you wish.\nNo one has any kindness or humanity||in this world...{PA:20}\nI have no regrets.\nI have no choice but to hang myself,||after all...\nJust tell me what happened.\nYes...{PA:20} As a matter of fact,\nI lost a confidential document||of my company.\nIt was kept in a briefcase||under lock and key...\nBut I was so nervous about it that||I don't even remember when I lost it...\nIs that so important that you gotta hang||yourself?\nOnly an office worker could relate to why||I'm hanging myself...{PA:20}\nI don't expect you to understand...\nGive him something?\n\nHaha...{PA:20}||Are you trying to give me some reassurance?\nAll I want now is the document that I lost||somewhere.{PA:20} I don't need your pity.\nHaha...{PA:20}||I don't need your pity.\n(I have nothing to give him...)\nT...{PA:10} That briefcase is...?!\nThat's the one!{PA:10}||That's the briefcase I lost!\nYou son of a bitch...{PA:10}||Why the hell did you steal it?!\nWhat?\nShut the fuck up!||You made a fool of me!!\nI'll kill you!\n"
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0047.BIN:82_0_0
