#. y1:english="Oh...{PA:10} Give it back to me!||Give me that briefcase back!\nThat's what I was trying to do from the||beginning!\nR...{PA:10} Really? Then...||Give it to me now!\nYou gave him the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Silver Briefcase{CR:00}\".\nThank goodness I got it back...{MS:0}||What a relief!\nYou saved my life! Oh...\nhere.{PA:10} Take this!\nYou received a \"Tortoiseshell Plate\".\n\nYou gained 500 exp.\nThis is all I can give you.||I hope it's of some use."
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0047.BIN:82_2_10
