#. y1:english="You gotta pay a toll if you wanna go any||further! {PA:20}So you gonna pass through?\nThe toll's 5,000 yen...{PA:10}||{MS:0}but since it's Christmas, it's 10,000 yen.\nPay me 10,000 yen.\nIf you don't wanna pay it,||that's fine by me.\nEveryone pays without arguing,||and I'm getting pretty damn bored...{PA:20}\nWhat do you say?{PA:10} Pay or not?{PA:10}\nOkay,{PA:10} I'll pay.\nThanks!{PA:20}||{MS:0}...What?{PA:10} You don't have enough cash!!\nGet the fucking money!!\n\nFuck you.\nWhat do you know...{PA:10}\nI haven't seen a hardheaded guy like you||for a long time.\nDon't let me down!\n\nReally.{PA:20} Then you should turn around||and go home.{PA:20}\nYou can't pass, if you don't have money or||strength.\n"
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0047.BIN:89_0_0
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0047.BIN::line:89_0_0"
msgid "iTienes que pagar peaje si quieres seguir!{PA:20}||¿Quieres pasar?"
msgstr ""

